		<span class="lewd">머릿속의 슬라임이 <<bhim>>에게 몸을 바치라고 명령하는 것을 느낀다.</span> 따르면 보상을 약속하고, 따르지 않으면 대가가 있을 것이라고 위협한다.
		<br><br>

		<<if hasSexStat("deviancy", 4) and $submissive gte 1900>>
			<<link [[기꺼이 복종한다|Pound Food Event Slime Submit willingly]]>><<corruption 3>><<pain -8>><<stress -12>><<trauma -24>><<sub 2>><</link>><<deviant4>><<ggcorruption>><<llpain>><<llltrauma>><<llstress>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<link [[복종한다|Pound Food Event Slime Obey]]>><<corruption 1>><<pain -4>><<stress -6>><<trauma -12>><<sub 1>><</link>><<gcorruption>><<lpain>><<lltrauma>><<lstress>>
		<br>
		<<link [[거역한다|Pound Food Event Slime Defy]]>><<corruption -1>><<pain 8>><<stress 6>><<trauma 6>><<def 1>><</link>><<lcorruption>><<ggpain>><<ggtrauma>><<ggstress>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $pound.status gte 80>>
		한 <<beasttype>>【이가】 <<bhis>> 눈에 욕정을 담고 멀리서 당신을 지켜보지만, 무슨 짓을 하려 들지는 않는다.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Pound Food End]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
